[
  {
    "index": 1,
    "row_index": 3,
    "speaker": "あかね",
    "text": "この町では、夜の六時になると、楽しいことが禁止になる",
    "voice_name": "Gracie",
    "voice_id": "09878754-f20b-5330-9790-58a8027ab5b2",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "row_index": 6,
    "speaker": "あかね",
    "text": "見つかったら、終わり",
    "voice_name": "Gracie",
    "voice_id": "09878754-f20b-5330-9790-58a8027ab5b2",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "row_index": 7,
    "speaker": "あかね",
    "text": "それでも、この扉を叩きに来る人がいる",
    "voice_name": "Gracie",
    "voice_id": "09878754-f20b-5330-9790-58a8027ab5b2",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "row_index": 11,
    "speaker": "あかね",
    "text": "明日なくなるかもしれない。だから――",
    "voice_name": "Gracie",
    "voice_id": "09878754-f20b-5330-9790-58a8027ab5b2",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "row_index": 13,
    "speaker": "あかね",
    "text": "……正解",
    "voice_name": "Gracie",
    "voice_id": "09878754-f20b-5330-9790-58a8027ab5b2",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "row_index": 14,
    "speaker": "あかね",
    "text": "――今夜も、扉を開ける",
    "voice_name": "Gracie",
    "voice_id": "09878754-f20b-5330-9790-58a8027ab5b2",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "row_index": 15,
    "speaker": "あかね",
    "text": "鼻歌。また外で歌ってきたでしょ",
    "voice_name": "Gracie",
    "voice_id": "09878754-f20b-5330-9790-58a8027ab5b2",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "row_index": 16,
    "speaker": "暁",
    "text": "あれくらい平気だろ",
    "voice_name": "Ainsley",
    "voice_id": "731b4ffe-e95e-59f4-8c00-81608936091f",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "row_index": 17,
    "speaker": "あかね",
    "text": "捕まっても知りませんからね",
    "voice_name": "Gracie",
    "voice_id": "09878754-f20b-5330-9790-58a8027ab5b2",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "row_index": 18,
    "speaker": "暁",
    "text": "そんときゃ差し入れ頼むわ",
    "voice_name": "Ainsley",
    "voice_id": "731b4ffe-e95e-59f4-8c00-81608936091f",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "row_index": 19,
    "speaker": "あかね",
    "text": "嫌です。……どうぞ、お入りください",
    "voice_name": "Gracie",
    "voice_id": "09878754-f20b-5330-9790-58a8027ab5b2",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "row_index": 26,
    "speaker": "まひる",
    "text": "できた！ まひる特製アフォガード！",
    "voice_name": "Chloe",
    "voice_id": "e9cfbbf0-4476-46be-b396-596eb774b165",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "row_index": 27,
    "speaker": "海凪",
    "text": "あぶない！",
    "voice_name": "Luna",
    "voice_id": "375a3398-e3b4-4f91-845d-42181e352899",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "row_index": 28,
    "speaker": "まひる",
    "text": "あっ……えへへー。さすが海凪ちゃん",
    "voice_name": "Chloe",
    "voice_id": "e9cfbbf0-4476-46be-b396-596eb774b165",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "row_index": 29,
    "speaker": "海凪",
    "text": "貴重な材料なんだから、無駄にしないの",
    "voice_name": "Luna",
    "voice_id": "375a3398-e3b4-4f91-845d-42181e352899",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "row_index": 30,
    "speaker": "まひる",
    "text": "んもう！ 海凪ちゃん、最近手厳しいんだけどー",
    "voice_name": "Chloe",
    "voice_id": "e9cfbbf0-4476-46be-b396-596eb774b165",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "row_index": 31,
    "speaker": "海凪",
    "text": "あかねさんだったら、もっと叱ってるわよ",
    "voice_name": "Luna",
    "voice_id": "375a3398-e3b4-4f91-845d-42181e352899",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "row_index": 32,
    "speaker": "朔奈",
    "text": "ふふ。あかねちゃんがいないときは、海凪ちゃんがお母さん役ね",
    "voice_name": "Liza",
    "voice_id": "1e7feef5-2436-55bd-8778-cb075ecd081e",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "row_index": 35,
    "speaker": "まひる",
    "text": "でもさー、外じゃ鼻歌もダメ、お酒もダメ、動物もダメって……",
    "voice_name": "Chloe",
    "voice_id": "e9cfbbf0-4476-46be-b396-596eb774b165",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "row_index": 36,
    "speaker": "朔奈",
    "text": "この町では、お酒を飲むことも――",
    "voice_name": "Liza",
    "voice_id": "1e7feef5-2436-55bd-8778-cb075ecd081e",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "row_index": 38,
    "speaker": "朔奈",
    "text": "音楽を楽しむことも――",
    "voice_name": "Liza",
    "voice_id": "1e7feef5-2436-55bd-8778-cb075ecd081e",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "row_index": 39,
    "speaker": "朔奈",
    "text": "動物と暮らすことも、禁じられている",
    "voice_name": "Liza",
    "voice_id": "1e7feef5-2436-55bd-8778-cb075ecd081e",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "row_index": 41,
    "speaker": "朔奈",
    "text": "どれも、なくても生きてはいけるもの。でも――",
    "voice_name": "Liza",
    "voice_id": "1e7feef5-2436-55bd-8778-cb075ecd081e",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "row_index": 43,
    "speaker": "まひる",
    "text": "でも、なかったらつまんないじゃん！",
    "voice_name": "Chloe",
    "voice_id": "e9cfbbf0-4476-46be-b396-596eb774b165",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "row_index": 44,
    "speaker": "朔奈",
    "text": "私は、こういう時間まで、なくしたくない",
    "voice_name": "Liza",
    "voice_id": "1e7feef5-2436-55bd-8778-cb075ecd081e",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 26,
    "row_index": 45,
    "speaker": "朔奈",
    "text": "だから今夜も、私たちはここにいる",
    "voice_name": "Liza",
    "voice_id": "1e7feef5-2436-55bd-8778-cb075ecd081e",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 27,
    "row_index": 46,
    "speaker": "朔奈",
    "text": "あら、来たわね",
    "voice_name": "Liza",
    "voice_id": "1e7feef5-2436-55bd-8778-cb075ecd081e",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 28,
    "row_index": 47,
    "speaker": "暁",
    "text": "おう",
    "voice_name": "Ainsley",
    "voice_id": "731b4ffe-e95e-59f4-8c00-81608936091f",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 29,
    "row_index": 48,
    "speaker": "朔奈",
    "text": "今日はちゃんと合言葉、覚えてた？",
    "voice_name": "Liza",
    "voice_id": "1e7feef5-2436-55bd-8778-cb075ecd081e",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 30,
    "row_index": 49,
    "speaker": "暁",
    "text": "当然だろ",
    "voice_name": "Ainsley",
    "voice_id": "731b4ffe-e95e-59f4-8c00-81608936091f",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 31,
    "row_index": 50,
    "speaker": "あかね",
    "text": "嘘です！ 海凪ちゃんの曲、歌ってましたもん！",
    "voice_name": "Gracie",
    "voice_id": "09878754-f20b-5330-9790-58a8027ab5b2",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 32,
    "row_index": 51,
    "speaker": "暁",
    "text": "余計なこと言うな",
    "voice_name": "Ainsley",
    "voice_id": "731b4ffe-e95e-59f4-8c00-81608936091f",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 33,
    "row_index": 52,
    "speaker": "暁",
    "text": "やっぱ、ここだな",
    "voice_name": "Ainsley",
    "voice_id": "731b4ffe-e95e-59f4-8c00-81608936091f",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 34,
    "row_index": 53,
    "speaker": "朔奈",
    "text": "おかえり、暁",
    "voice_name": "Liza",
    "voice_id": "1e7feef5-2436-55bd-8778-cb075ecd081e",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 35,
    "row_index": 54,
    "speaker": "暁",
    "text": "おう。ただいま",
    "voice_name": "Ainsley",
    "voice_id": "731b4ffe-e95e-59f4-8c00-81608936091f",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 36,
    "row_index": 55,
    "speaker": "まひる",
    "text": "あかねちゃん、今日も暁さんに怒ってたでしょー",
    "voice_name": "Chloe",
    "voice_id": "e9cfbbf0-4476-46be-b396-596eb774b165",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 37,
    "row_index": 56,
    "speaker": "あかね",
    "text": "だって、外で鼻歌なんて歌ってくるから！ それで目をつけられたらどうするの？",
    "voice_name": "Gracie",
    "voice_id": "09878754-f20b-5330-9790-58a8027ab5b2",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 38,
    "row_index": 57,
    "speaker": "朔奈",
    "text": "ふふ。あかねちゃんがいてくれるから、みんな安心してここに来られるのよ",
    "voice_name": "Liza",
    "voice_id": "1e7feef5-2436-55bd-8778-cb075ecd081e",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 39,
    "row_index": 59,
    "speaker": "まひる",
    "text": "……三禁って、いつまで続くんだろうね。ほんっと、つまんない町になったよねー",
    "voice_name": "Chloe",
    "voice_id": "e9cfbbf0-4476-46be-b396-596eb774b165",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 40,
    "row_index": 61,
    "speaker": "あかね",
    "text": "……私は、嫌です",
    "voice_name": "Gracie",
    "voice_id": "09878754-f20b-5330-9790-58a8027ab5b2",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 41,
    "row_index": 62,
    "speaker": "あかね",
    "text": "お酒を飲んだり、音楽を聴いたり、動物と一緒にいるだけで、悪い人みたいにされるの",
    "voice_name": "Gracie",
    "voice_id": "09878754-f20b-5330-9790-58a8027ab5b2",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 42,
    "row_index": 63,
    "speaker": "あかね",
    "text": "だって、ここにいる人たちが、悪い人たちだと思います？",
    "voice_name": "Gracie",
    "voice_id": "09878754-f20b-5330-9790-58a8027ab5b2",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 43,
    "row_index": 64,
    "speaker": "海凪",
    "text": "……思わない",
    "voice_name": "Luna",
    "voice_id": "375a3398-e3b4-4f91-845d-42181e352899",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 44,
    "row_index": 65,
    "speaker": "まひる",
    "text": "全然！ むしろ楽しそうじゃん",
    "voice_name": "Chloe",
    "voice_id": "e9cfbbf0-4476-46be-b396-596eb774b165",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 45,
    "row_index": 66,
    "speaker": "朔奈",
    "text": "お酒や音楽で人がつながることまで、悪いことだとは、私は思わないわ",
    "voice_name": "Liza",
    "voice_id": "1e7feef5-2436-55bd-8778-cb075ecd081e",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 46,
    "row_index": 72,
    "speaker": "まひる",
    "text": "え、なにそれ！ 私も入るー！",
    "voice_name": "Chloe",
    "voice_id": "e9cfbbf0-4476-46be-b396-596eb774b165",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 47,
    "row_index": 73,
    "speaker": "あかね",
    "text": "まひるちゃんは仕事！ ……あっ",
    "voice_name": "Gracie",
    "voice_id": "09878754-f20b-5330-9790-58a8027ab5b2",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 48,
    "row_index": 74,
    "speaker": "朔奈",
    "text": "それくらいは、いいんじゃない？ ……ここでくらい、ね",
    "voice_name": "Liza",
    "voice_id": "1e7feef5-2436-55bd-8778-cb075ecd081e",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 49,
    "row_index": 75,
    "speaker": "あかね",
    "text": "……はい！",
    "voice_name": "Gracie",
    "voice_id": "09878754-f20b-5330-9790-58a8027ab5b2",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 50,
    "row_index": 84,
    "speaker": "まひる",
    "text": "……やば。捜査官じゃん",
    "voice_name": "Chloe",
    "voice_id": "e9cfbbf0-4476-46be-b396-596eb774b165",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 51,
    "row_index": 85,
    "speaker": "朔奈",
    "text": "落ち着いて、ただの見回りよ",
    "voice_name": "Liza",
    "voice_id": "1e7feef5-2436-55bd-8778-cb075ecd081e",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 52,
    "row_index": 86,
    "speaker": "海凪",
    "text": "……行って",
    "voice_name": "Luna",
    "voice_id": "375a3398-e3b4-4f91-845d-42181e352899",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 53,
    "row_index": 87,
    "speaker": "暁",
    "text": "……もう行ったか？",
    "voice_name": "Ainsley",
    "voice_id": "731b4ffe-e95e-59f4-8c00-81608936091f",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 54,
    "row_index": 88,
    "speaker": "暁",
    "text": "むぐっ",
    "voice_name": "Ainsley",
    "voice_id": "731b4ffe-e95e-59f4-8c00-81608936091f",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 55,
    "row_index": 88,
    "speaker": "あかね",
    "text": "しっ！",
    "voice_name": "Gracie",
    "voice_id": "09878754-f20b-5330-9790-58a8027ab5b2",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 56,
    "row_index": 90,
    "speaker": "ステラ",
    "text": "ニャー！",
    "voice_name": "Gracie",
    "voice_id": "09878754-f20b-5330-9790-58a8027ab5b2",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 57,
    "row_index": 92,
    "speaker": "あかね",
    "text": "ステラちゃん……！",
    "voice_name": "Gracie",
    "voice_id": "09878754-f20b-5330-9790-58a8027ab5b2",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 58,
    "row_index": 97,
    "speaker": "朔奈",
    "text": "……大丈夫そうね",
    "voice_name": "Liza",
    "voice_id": "1e7feef5-2436-55bd-8778-cb075ecd081e",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 59,
    "row_index": 99,
    "speaker": "まひる",
    "text": "はぁー……やばかったんだけどー……！",
    "voice_name": "Chloe",
    "voice_id": "e9cfbbf0-4476-46be-b396-596eb774b165",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 60,
    "row_index": 100,
    "speaker": "あかね",
    "text": "ほんと、心臓止まるかと思いました……",
    "voice_name": "Gracie",
    "voice_id": "09878754-f20b-5330-9790-58a8027ab5b2",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 61,
    "row_index": 101,
    "speaker": "暁",
    "text": "私なんか口塞がれたぞ",
    "voice_name": "Ainsley",
    "voice_id": "731b4ffe-e95e-59f4-8c00-81608936091f",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 62,
    "row_index": 102,
    "speaker": "あかね",
    "text": "暁さんが動くからです！",
    "voice_name": "Gracie",
    "voice_id": "09878754-f20b-5330-9790-58a8027ab5b2",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 63,
    "row_index": 103,
    "speaker": "朔奈",
    "text": "……もう一曲、お願いしてもいい？",
    "voice_name": "Liza",
    "voice_id": "1e7feef5-2436-55bd-8778-cb075ecd081e",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 64,
    "row_index": 104,
    "speaker": "海凪",
    "text": "はい",
    "voice_name": "Luna",
    "voice_id": "375a3398-e3b4-4f91-845d-42181e352899",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 65,
    "row_index": 108,
    "speaker": "先輩",
    "text": "ん？",
    "voice_name": "Gracie",
    "voice_id": "09878754-f20b-5330-9790-58a8027ab5b2",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 66,
    "row_index": 109,
    "speaker": "後輩",
    "text": "なんかウザい上官でも見つけちゃいましたー？",
    "voice_name": "Ainsley",
    "voice_id": "731b4ffe-e95e-59f4-8c00-81608936091f",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 67,
    "row_index": 110,
    "speaker": "先輩",
    "text": "んや。猫の鳴き声がした気がしてな",
    "voice_name": "Gracie",
    "voice_id": "09878754-f20b-5330-9790-58a8027ab5b2",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 68,
    "row_index": 111,
    "speaker": "後輩",
    "text": "ここ、先輩がよく行ってるパン屋っすよね？",
    "voice_name": "Ainsley",
    "voice_id": "731b4ffe-e95e-59f4-8c00-81608936091f",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 69,
    "row_index": 112,
    "speaker": "先輩",
    "text": "そうじゃ。特に日替わりのクロワッサンが絶品で――",
    "voice_name": "Gracie",
    "voice_id": "09878754-f20b-5330-9790-58a8027ab5b2",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 70,
    "row_index": 113,
    "speaker": "後輩",
    "text": "あー、酔っ払い発見",
    "voice_name": "Ainsley",
    "voice_id": "731b4ffe-e95e-59f4-8c00-81608936091f",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 71,
    "row_index": 114,
    "speaker": "先輩",
    "text": "チッ、行くぞ！",
    "voice_name": "Gracie",
    "voice_id": "09878754-f20b-5330-9790-58a8027ab5b2",
    "group": false
  },
  {
    "index": 72,
    "row_index": 116,
    "speaker": "先輩",
    "text": "……ここはマークしておけばよい",
    "voice_name": "Gracie",
    "voice_id": "09878754-f20b-5330-9790-58a8027ab5b2",
    "group": false
  },
  {
